{"id":"obesity","cards":[{"id":"obesit691ac8f5","l":2,"f":"Group with the highest prevalence of obesity worldwide","b":"keyed <b>Western low socioeconomic</b> groups","c":"The Big Picture"},{"id":"obesit253f4cf1","l":2,"f":"Basal metabolic rate of an obese person vs a normal-weight person of the same age and sex","b":"<b>more</b> (a larger body has more lean and fat mass to maintain)","c":"The Big Picture"},{"id":"obesit4bbe586e","l":2,"f":"Why obese patients have more surgical complications","b":"keyed \"<b>procedures could take a longer time</b>\"","c":"The Big Picture"},{"id":"obesitcb9c61d7","l":2,"f":"Obese 40-year-old rated low-to-intermediate risk for day surgery","b":"because of <b>BMI 32.2</b>","c":"The Big Picture"},{"id":"obesit46773c45","l":2,"f":"4 years after RYGB, severe central colic, stable","b":"keyed <b>adhesions</b> (commonest cause of SBO overall; internal hernia is the key differential after RYGB)","c":"The Big Picture"},{"id":"obesit7bdd1e0f","l":2,"f":"5 weeks after bypass, <b>solids → then liquids</b> not tolerated","b":"<b>gastrojejunal stricture</b>","c":"The Big Picture"},{"id":"obesit062e8692","l":1,"f":"<b>≥ 40</b> — Surgery indicated when?","b":"Always (severe / morbid obesity)","c":"Indications"},{"id":"obesit796652d1","l":1,"f":"<b>≥ 40</b> — Notes?","b":"Indicated <b>even without comorbidities</b>","c":"Indications"},{"id":"obesite785b28b","l":1,"f":"<b>≥ 35</b> — Surgery indicated when?","b":"Obesity-related <b>comorbidity</b> present","c":"Indications"},{"id":"obesit22a38210","l":1,"f":"<b>≥ 35</b> — Notes?","b":"<b>T2DM</b>, <b>hypertension</b>, <b>dyslipidemia</b>, <b>obstructive sleep apnea</b> <b>(OSA)</b>","c":"Indications"},{"id":"obesita1ab771c","l":1,"f":"<b>≥ 30</b> — Surgery indicated when?","b":"Can be <b>considered</b> with <b>metabolic</b> <b>disease</b>","c":"Indications"},{"id":"obesit4351ec23","l":1,"f":"<b>≥ 30</b> — Notes?","b":"Especially <b>uncontrolled T2DM</b>; from the <b>updated ASMBS</b> <b>guidelines</b>","c":"Indications"},{"id":"obesit2f1890c0","l":2,"f":"RYGB is indicated for which comorbidity","b":"<b>diabetes mellitus</b> (best metabolic effect)","c":"Indications"},{"id":"obesitb0bb5543","l":2,"f":"In morbid obesity, all are complications of OSA <b>except</b>","b":"<b>hypocarbia</b> (OSA causes <b>hypercarbia</b>, hypoxia and right heart failure)","c":"Indications"},{"id":"obesit2c28bf5a","l":1,"f":"<b>Severe / high-grade esophagitis</b> — Rules out?","b":"<b>Sleeve gastrectomy</b> <b>(LSG)</b>","c":"Contraindications"},{"id":"obesitbaba0390","l":1,"f":"<b>Severe / high-grade esophagitis</b> — Key point?","b":"Not necessarily a contraindication to <b>all</b> bariatric surgery","c":"Contraindications"},{"id":"obesit27bd67b0","l":1,"f":"<b>GERD</b> — Rules out?","b":"<b>Not absolute</b>","c":"Contraindications"},{"id":"obesit913c1f63","l":1,"f":"<b>GERD</b> — Key point?","b":"Obesity + significant reflux → often a <b>better candidate for</b> <b>RYGB</b>","c":"Contraindications"},{"id":"obesit13875d3d","l":1,"f":"<b>Unfit for anaesthesia / surgery</b> — Rules out?","b":"All bariatric surgery","c":"Contraindications"},{"id":"obesit1a7d0a45","l":1,"f":"<b>Unfit for anaesthesia / surgery</b> — Key point?","b":"Any condition preventing <b>safe general anaesthesia</b> or surgery","c":"Contraindications"},{"id":"obesit1017758c","l":1,"f":"<b>Pregnancy</b> — Rules out?","b":"All bariatric surgery","c":"Contraindications"},{"id":"obesit1f522a17","l":1,"f":"<b>Pregnancy</b> — Key point?","b":"General contraindication","c":"Contraindications"},{"id":"obesitb0f42170","l":2,"f":"Absolute contraindication to bariatric surgery","b":"keyed <b>psychological disturbances</b> (untreated psychiatric illness, e.g. binge eating, substance abuse)","c":"Contraindications"},{"id":"obesitc2e8d61b","l":1,"f":"<b>Sleeve gastrectomy (LSG)</b> — How common?","b":"<b>Most commonly performed</b> bariatric procedure","c":"Sleeve vs Bypass"},{"id":"obesitcee5dce0","l":1,"f":"<b>Roux-en-Y gastric bypass (RYGB)</b> — How common?","b":"Less often than LSG","c":"Sleeve vs Bypass"},{"id":"obesit70c4f8c0","l":1,"f":"<b>Sleeve gastrectomy (LSG)</b> — Mechanism?","b":"<b>Primarily restrictive</b>: ↓ gastric capacity → ↓ intake / calories → weight loss; may have additional <b>metabolic</b> effects","c":"Sleeve vs Bypass"},{"id":"obesit5c7ea6bf","l":1,"f":"<b>Roux-en-Y gastric bypass (RYGB)</b> — Mechanism?","b":"<b>Restriction + malabsorption</b>","c":"Sleeve vs Bypass"},{"id":"obesitc7afcab3","l":1,"f":"<b>Sleeve gastrectomy (LSG)</b> — Restrictive part?","b":"Stomach stapled along a <b>bougie-calibrated sleeve</b>; the rest is removed","c":"Sleeve vs Bypass"},{"id":"obesit0f44a5b9","l":1,"f":"<b>Roux-en-Y gastric bypass (RYGB)</b> — Restrictive part?","b":"<b>Small proximal gastric pouch</b> limits intake","c":"Sleeve vs Bypass"},{"id":"obesit14760978","l":1,"f":"<b>Sleeve gastrectomy (LSG)</b> — Malabsorption?","b":"<b>Minimal</b> direct malabsorption","c":"Sleeve vs Bypass"},{"id":"obesit8ef078c4","l":1,"f":"<b>Roux-en-Y gastric bypass (RYGB)</b> — Malabsorption?","b":"<b>Greater</b>: small-bowel bypass (≈100 cm Roux + ≈150 cm biliopancreatic limb) → ↓ nutrient absorption","c":"Sleeve vs Bypass"},{"id":"obesite2171678","l":1,"f":"<b>Sleeve gastrectomy (LSG)</b> — Reflux / esophagitis?","b":"<b>Severe esophagitis</b> = contraindication","c":"Sleeve vs Bypass"},{"id":"obesit3ba531c7","l":1,"f":"<b>Roux-en-Y gastric bypass (RYGB)</b> — Reflux / esophagitis?","b":"<b>Preferred</b> in obesity with significant GERD","c":"Sleeve vs Bypass"},{"id":"obesitd5d61fb4","l":1,"f":"<b>Sleeve gastrectomy (LSG)</b> — Nutritional deficiencies?","b":"Less common","c":"Sleeve vs Bypass"},{"id":"obesitd2fe59ac","l":1,"f":"<b>Roux-en-Y gastric bypass (RYGB)</b> — Nutritional deficiencies?","b":"<b>More common</b>","c":"Sleeve vs Bypass"},{"id":"obesitf8ab5b3a","l":1,"f":"<b>Sleeve gastrectomy (LSG)</b> — Internal hernia?","b":"Particularly after <b>gastric bypass</b>; generally needs surgical management","c":"Sleeve vs Bypass"},{"id":"obesit262b3036","l":2,"f":"Work-up of an obese patient is directed towards","b":"<b>comorbidities</b>","c":"Sleeve vs Bypass"},{"id":"obesitba5fc052","l":2,"f":"Healthy woman, failed supervised programmes, <b>GERD with oesophagitis on PPIs</b>","b":"<b>Roux-en-Y gastric bypass</b>","c":"Sleeve vs Bypass"},{"id":"obesit3b677897","l":2,"f":"Sleeve 3 years ago with weight regain (BMI 40 → 48), <b>mid-sleeve stricture, dilated fundus and severe GERD</b>","b":"<b>convert to Roux-en-Y gastric bypass</b>","c":"Sleeve vs Bypass"},{"id":"obesitd568f772","l":2,"f":"Marginal ulcer after Roux-en-Y — most common cause","b":"<b>NSAIDs</b>","c":"Sleeve vs Bypass"},{"id":"obesita316fb09","l":1,"f":"<b>Labs + nutritional assessment</b> — When?","b":"<b>All</b> patients","c":"Investigations"},{"id":"obesitfd654da4","l":1,"f":"<b>Labs + nutritional assessment</b> — Purpose?","b":"Baseline <b>metabolic and nutritional</b> status","c":"Investigations"},{"id":"obesit6a650308","l":1,"f":"<b>ECG + chest X-ray</b> — When?","b":"<b>Routine</b> (as described in lecture)","c":"Investigations"},{"id":"obesit6796c3b3","l":1,"f":"<b>ECG + chest X-ray</b> — Purpose?","b":"Standard preoperative work-up","c":"Investigations"},{"id":"obesit4fe3b102","l":1,"f":"<b>Upper GI endoscopy (EGD)</b> — When?","b":"Symptoms of <b>GERD / reflux</b>","c":"Investigations"},{"id":"obesitedade3cc","l":1,"f":"<b>Upper GI endoscopy (EGD)</b> — Purpose?","b":"Evaluate reflux (severe esophagitis changes the choice of operation)","c":"Investigations"},{"id":"obesit417045c8","l":1,"f":"<b>Abdominal ultrasound</b> — When?","b":"Symptoms of <b>biliary colic</b>: RUQ pain, worse with fatty meals ± radiation to the right shoulder","c":"Investigations"},{"id":"obesit4f0248c5","l":1,"f":"<b>Abdominal ultrasound</b> — Purpose?","b":"Evaluate suspected gallstone disease","c":"Investigations"},{"id":"obesit3f2ee189","l":1,"f":"<b>Upper GI contrast / barium swallow</b> — When?","b":"<b>Revisional</b> surgery (previous sleeve, bypass or other bariatric procedure)","c":"Investigations"},{"id":"obesit4872da08","l":1,"f":"<b>Upper GI contrast / barium swallow</b> — Purpose?","b":"Assess the anatomy left by the previous operation","c":"Investigations"},{"id":"obesit6e414133","l":2,"f":"4 weeks after LRYGB, on-and-off severe epigastric pain with <b>blood-stained vomiting</b>, stable, soft abdomen","b":"<b>upper GI endoscopy</b> (marginal ulcer)","c":"Investigations"},{"id":"obesit9fb7f7bd","l":2,"f":"3 years after sleeve: RUQ pain, jaundice, gallbladder stones and an 11-mm CBD","b":"<b>ERCP followed by cholecystectomy</b> (the papilla is still reachable after a sleeve, unlike after RYGB)","c":"Investigations"},{"id":"obesit71988672","l":1,"f":"<b>VTE (DVT / PE)</b> — Agent?","b":"<b>Enoxaparin</b>","c":"Prophylaxis"},{"id":"obesit5d9b5e10","l":1,"f":"<b>VTE (DVT / PE)</b> — Lower BMI / weight?","b":"<b>40 mg</b> if BMI &lt; 50","c":"Prophylaxis"},{"id":"obesit7ce096d5","l":1,"f":"<b>VTE (DVT / PE)</b> — Higher BMI / weight?","b":"<b>60 mg</b> if BMI ≥ 50","c":"Prophylaxis"},{"id":"obesit59607775","l":1,"f":"<b>Surgical site infection</b> — Agent?","b":"<b>Cefazolin</b> (usual choice)","c":"Prophylaxis"},{"id":"obesitdbb16dae","l":1,"f":"<b>Surgical site infection</b> — Lower BMI / weight?","b":"<b>2 g</b>","c":"Prophylaxis"},{"id":"obesitadc45157","l":1,"f":"<b>Surgical site infection</b> — Higher BMI / weight?","b":"<b>3 g</b>","c":"Prophylaxis"},{"id":"obesitbdbb5625","l":2,"f":"After sleeve: <b>tachycardia and falling urine output</b>","b":"<b>leak</b>","c":"Positioning & draping"},{"id":"obesitbbf47b55","l":1,"f":"<b>Distal (lower) stomach</b> — Gastric wall?","b":"<b>Thicker</b>","c":"Sleeve Gastrectomy: Technique"},{"id":"obesitc27bbb81","l":1,"f":"<b>Distal (lower) stomach</b> — Cartridge?","b":"<b>Thicker-tissue</b> cartridges","c":"Sleeve Gastrectomy: Technique"},{"id":"obesit7cd3b44e","l":1,"f":"<b>Proximal (upper) stomach</b> — Gastric wall?","b":"<b>Thinner</b>","c":"Sleeve Gastrectomy: Technique"},{"id":"obesit6a3d5092","l":1,"f":"<b>Proximal (upper) stomach</b> — Cartridge?","b":"<b>Thinner-tissue</b> cartridges","c":"Sleeve Gastrectomy: Technique"},{"id":"obesit7ce2082e","l":1,"f":"<b>Complication</b> — list them","b":"<b>Staple-line</b> <b>leak</b> · <b>Postoperative</b> <b>bleeding</b>","c":"Complications"},{"id":"obesita4b1cf27","l":1,"f":"<b>Hemodynamically stable</b> — list them","b":"<b>NPO</b> · nutritional support via <b>feeding tube</b> when appropriate · <b>IR drainage</b> of intra-abdominal collections · <b>endoscopic</b> management when indicated · <b>Conservative</b> management / observation as appropriate","c":"Complications"},{"id":"obesit5d590bac","l":1,"f":"<b>Hemodynamically unstable</b> — list them","b":"<b>Urgent operative</b> exploration / intervention · <b>Urgent</b> intervention or surgery","c":"Complications"},{"id":"obesit35bbaa5d","l":2,"f":"10 days after sleeve: <b>persistent hiccups</b>, HR 112, T 39 °C","b":"after resuscitation, <b>CT abdomen to rule out leak or abscess</b> (subphrenic collection irritates the diaphragm)","c":"Complications"},{"id":"obesit333e718c","l":2,"f":"Overt leak 1 week after sleeve, <b>unstable with peritonitis</b>","b":"after resuscitation, <b>surgical control of the leak, irrigation and drainage</b>","c":"Complications"},{"id":"obesita404d5a0","l":2,"f":"Gastric fistula of 250 mL/day 7 days after sleeve","b":"most associated with <b>hypokalaemia</b>","c":"Complications"},{"id":"obesit927aa4e9","l":2,"f":"2 months after gastric bypass with obstruction — most common cause besides adhesions","b":"<b>internal hernia</b>","c":"Complications"},{"id":"obesit7de886b7","l":2,"f":"Complication of obesity surgery → <b>increased gallstone formation</b> (rapid weight loss","b":"more cholesterol in bile)","c":"Complications"},{"id":"obesitdb6c27e0","l":2,"f":"2 years after sleeve with <b>hyperparathyroidism</b>","b":"<b>vitamin D deficiency</b> (secondary hyperparathyroidism)","c":"Complications"},{"id":"obesit8417f360","l":2,"f":"Rapid weight loss on <b>Mounjaro (tirzepatide)</b>, abdominal distension relieved by vomiting","b":"<b>SMA syndrome</b> (third part of the duodenum compressed between the SMA and aorta)","c":"Complications"}]}